flowchart TD
    U[User in browser] --> UI[Static browser UI]
    UI -->|POST code + task| API[FastAPI validation and limits]
    API --> AST[Python AST heuristic checks]
    AST --> R[Offline summary / task scaffold]
    API -->|Only if explicitly selected and configured| LLM[OpenAI-compatible chat endpoint]
    AST --> OUT[Response with findings and caveats]
    R --> OUT
    LLM --> OUT
    OUT --> UI
    AST -. never imports or executes submitted code .-> SAFE[No code execution]
